		<string text="The dead fall limp, thrown by what killed them,\nand lie where they come to rest."/>
		<string text="With ragdolls, blasts tear off the limbs and\nheads they hurt most. Bullets tear nothing."/>
		<string text="Casings, gibs and broken pieces bounce, roll and\ntumble on the level and off each other."/>
